**Why pasting into Gravity failed**: `GravityMode.pasteClipboard` silently does nothing (no error, no message, no visual feedback) whenever *every* cell being pasted lands on an already-occupied position — `if (!placed.length) return;` in `[REDACTED_PRIVATE_INFO]`. I reproduced this precisely: copying Gravity's own current board and immediately pasting it back (copy → paste, same mode, no other action in between) leaves the board completely unchanged, with the clipboard correctly populated (3 cells copied) but zero cells actually placed.

